### Library Management API - Reservations
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Login as Member
# @name loginMember
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member@library.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@memberToken = {{loginMember.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. Reserve a Book (Allowed when available_copies = 0)
# @name createReservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "b2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

@reservationId = {{createReservation.response.body.id}}

### 2. View My Reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 3. Cancel My Reservation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
